    "type": "object",
    "x_constraint": "双层契约：① JSON Schema 不对 inputs 内字段使用 required，与 validate-input、降级调用（仅单号/诉求等）及 design.md 示例 2 一致。② 编排闭环语义以本块 x_invoke_contract 为准（同步至注册表 io 列）：须含完整轨迹与上游 analysis；正式分析前编排器须先跑 delivery-status 并 merge。",
    "x_invoke_contract": "编排闭环时除 inputs 外，调用 JSON 顶层须包含 inputContext：\n- previousOutput：上游 result 对象，须含非空字符串 analysis（轨迹/妥投/状态解读）。\n- 建议 sourceExpertId=\"delivery-status\"、chainId 与前置 job 一致。\ninputs.enrichedContext 宜含 trajectories 键（数组，与 delivery-status merge 输出对齐；无节点时可为 []）。降级调用可无 enrichedContext，由 Prompt 走 need_info。",
    "properties": {
      "trackingIds": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "轨迹单号（可与 enrichedContext 内反填并存）"
      },
      "outboundOrderNos": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "出库单号"
      },
      "enrichedContext": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "前置轨迹专家合并后的完整轨迹载荷；编排闭环宜含 trajectories；与 delivery-status §3 对齐（降级可不传本对象）",
        "properties": {
          "trajectories": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "轨迹节点列表（编排推荐；可与上游 merge-enriched-context 一致；无数据时可为空数组）",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          },
          "fetchMeta": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "拉取元数据、兜底说明等",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "analysisClock": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "分析用时钟（与时区敏感推理）",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "trajectorySummary": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "轨迹摘要（可选；不可替代 previousOutput.analysis）"
          },
          "deliveredEvent": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "妥投事件提炼（可选）",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "orderDetails": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "出库单摘要（可选）",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          },
          "podSignals": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "POD 线索（可选）",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "customerStatedFacts": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "客户已陈述事实（可选）"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "claimChannelKnown": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "上游是否已确认存在可索赔渠道；未传则由模型结合上下文推断并标注不确定性"
      }
    }
  },
  "outputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "structured": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "含 branch、trackingIds、outboundOrderNos、suggestedNextExperts、missingFacts；见 design.md §2.1"
      },
      "analysis": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "分析结论与建议话术"
      }
    }
  }
}

